            "text": "{\"model\":\"anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What is the weather in Tokyo? Use get_weather, then answer in one short sentence. Then solve, reasoning it through first: a train leaves at 09:47 and travels 283 km at 74 km/h; when does it arrive, to the minute?\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_016ZQNPKG8bgH9jsATBECXvW\",\"name\":\"get_weather\",\"input\":{\"city\":\"Tokyo\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_016ZQNPKG8bgH9jsATBECXvW\",\"content\":\"Tokyo: clear\\n25°C, wind 10 km/h\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"I'm dividing 283 by 74 to get about 3.82 hours, which converts to 3 hours and roughly 49.5 minutes. Adding that to 09:47 puts the arrival around 13:36, with the exact value a little over that.\\n\\nI'm confirming the arrival time at 13:36, since the 28 seconds past the minute don't change the displayed result.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGNsYXVkZS1vbi1hd3MifQ\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tokyo is clear, 25°C, with a 10 km/h wind.\\n\\nTravel time is 283 ÷ 74 ≈ 3.824 h. That is 3 h plus 0.824 × 60 ≈ 49.46 min, or about 3 h 49 min 28 s.\\n\\nAdding that to 09:47 gives 13:36:28, so the train arrives at about **13:36**.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Should I bring an umbrella? One word.\",\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}],\"max_tokens\":128000,\"stream\":true,\"system\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You are a weather assistant. Answer briefly.\\n\\n<addendum>\\